{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20262d41pW1Rbk1792795112.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>金價跌穿4,000美元水平，見三個月低位，並錄得四個多月以來最大單星期跌幅。</p><p></p><p>紐約期金收市報4,007.9美元一盎司，跌52.5美元，跌幅近百分之1.3。</p><p></p><p>現貨金價收市報3,996.1美元，跌28.75美元，跌幅百分之0.7，全個星期計，跌了百分之4，是六月以來最大單星期跌幅。</p><p></p><p>國際油價升至半年高位，引發市場加深通脹憂慮，利率向上機會增加，利淡無利息回報的黃金價格。加上科技股被拋售，亦逼使不少投資者沽出貴金屬資產補倉，推低金價。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T23:24:31.628566+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T22:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T05:18:12.794921+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T23:18:11.993537+00:00","content_hash":"c17168d58042df6e91e552f6cd48b1d824ff940f6a1104fdc88075e4b8fc230b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T23:24:31.628566+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}